<title>JAPAN: Japan govt spokesman says worried about stocks.</title>
<headline>Japan govt spokesman says worried about stocks.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's chief government spokesman Seiroku Kajiyama said on Friday that he was worried about the sluggish stock market.</p>
<p>The sluggishness may be partly due to the uncertainties that market participants have over the prospects for the Japanese economy, he told a news conference.</p>
</text>
